  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN240.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">tōḻi iravukkuṟi vanta talaimakaṟkup pakaṟkuṟi nērntatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">How the cofindante granted a day tryst to HIM who had come for a night tryst.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN240.1">
        <l>cevvi ñāḻaṟ karuṅkōṭ ṭañciṉait</l>
        <l>taṉippārp puḷḷiya taṇpaṟai nārai</l>
        <l>maṇippū neytaṉ mākkaḻi nivappa</l>
        <l>viṉippulam piṉṟē kāṉalu naḷikaṭaṟ</l>
        <l>ṟiraiccura muḻanta tiṇṭimil viḷakkiṟ</l>
        <l>paṉmīṉ <supplied>kū</supplied>ṭṭa <supplied>me</supplied>ṉṉaiyark kāṭṭiya</l>
        <l>ventaiyuñ cellumā riravē yanti</l>
        <l>laṇaṅkuṭaip paṉittuṟai kaitoḻu tētti</l>
        <l>yāyu māyamō ṭayaru nīyun</l>
        <l>tēmpā yōti tirunuta ṉīvik</l>
        <l>kōṅkumukait taṉṉa kuvimulai yākat</l>
        <l>tiṉṟuyi lamarntaṉai yāyiṉ vaṇṭupaṭa</l>
        <l>virinta cerunti veṇmaṇaṉ mu<supplied>ṭu</supplied>kkarp</l>
        <l>pūvēy puṉṉaiyan taṇpoḻil</l>
        <l>vāvē te<supplied>y</supplied>ya maṇantaṉai celaṟkē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="4a">Now,</l>
        <l corresp="2">as the heron with cool wings, that remembered [its] solitary young one</l>
        <l corresp="1">on the pretty twig of the black branch of the red Ñāḻal tree,</l>
        <l corresp="3">rises from the dark backwaters with sapphire-flowered waterlilies,</l>
        <l corresp="4bc">the seashore grove has become lonely,</l>
        <l corresp="7a-c">and my father goes, at night,</l>
        <l corresp="6">to show to my people swarms of many fish</l>
        <l corresp="4d-5">by the lamp of the steady boats that have borne the wave desert of the vast sea,</l>
        <l corresp="9a-c">and my mother with [her] companions is immersed</l>
        <l corresp="7d-8">in praising [and] worshipping the big ghat with [its] fearful spirit there,</l>
        <l rend="indent8" corresp="9d">and you,</l>
        <l>if you were to stroke [her] luminous forehead with honey-scented hair</l>
        <l corresp="10 12a-c">[and] abide in sweet sleep</l>
        <l corresp="11">on [her] bosom with breasts round as the buds of the Koṅku,</l>
        <l corresp="15">[you would have to] come [now] , in order to go after you have united with [her],</l>
        <l corresp="14">to the cool Puṉṉai grove covered in flowers,</l>
        <l corresp="12d-13">by the path of white sand with pear trees that have expanded for the bees to come.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

